Use the root @AGENTS.md as the shared repository instructions. Cursor can also
discover that file directly. Read it before changing server or automation code.

Keep Canvas read/write tools separate and respect `CANVAS_READ_ONLY`. Mock HTTP
in tests; do not open `.env` while exploring the source. Put reports and logs in
`.local/`. Keep MCP configurations specific
to a contributor's computer out of commits. Use the root README's setup steps.
